del/\" data-go=\"4\"><span class=\"hx-rn\"><span class=\"en\">Lab</span></span><span class=\"en hx-rt\">HK Site Model</span><span class=\"hx-ry\"><span class=\"en\">21 Oct</span></span></a></li><li class=\"k-journal\" data-new=\"\"><a href=\"journal/not-yet-known-expected-by-date/\" data-go=\"5\"><span class=\"hx-rn\"><span class=\"en\">Journal</span></span><span class=\"en hx-rt\">&quot;Not yet known. Expected by [date].&quot; That may be the most useful line pre-construction…</span><span class=\"hx-ry\"><span class=\"en\">20 Oct</span></span></a></li>"}, "zh": {"slides": "<li class=\"hx-s fit ed k-journal\" data-i=\"3\" data-new=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><a href=\"journal/add-one-building-what-happens-wind/\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"hx-bg\"><img data-src=\"../journal/img/add-one-building-what-happens-wind/thumb.webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\"></span><span class=\"hx-card\"><img data-src=\"../journal/img/add-one-building-what-happens-wind/01.webp\" sizes=\"(max-width:860px) 100vw, 72vw\" alt=\"\" width=\"1080\" height=\"1080\" decoding=\"async\"></span><span class=\"hx-ed\"><span class=\"zh hx-ei\" lang=\"zh-Hant\"><span class=\"hx-ek\">2026 年 10 月 21 日 · AI 新聞</span><span class=\"hx-eq\"><b aria-hidden=\"true\">&ldquo;</b>全部喺你部電腦度計，冇嘢上載。</span><span class=\"hx-cta\">閱讀全文 &rarr;</span></span></span></a><em class=\"hx-kind k-journal\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hant\">文章</span></em></li><li class=\"hx-s fit ed k-lab\" data-i=\"4\" data-new=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><a href=\"lab/hk-site-model/\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"hx-bg\"><img data-src=\"../img/lab/hk-site-model.webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\"></span><span class=\"hx-card\"><img data-src=\"../img/lab/hk-site-model.webp\" sizes=\"(max-width:860px) 100vw, 72vw\" alt=\"\" width=\"1200\" height=\"900\" decoding=\"async\"></span><span class=\"hx-ed\"><span class=\"zh hx-ei\" lang=\"zh-Hant\"><span class=\"hx-ek\">10月21日 · 立體地盤模型 · 香港</span><span class=\"hx-es\">在香港任何地方選取 250 米、500 米或 1 公里見方的範圍，下載立體體量模型：地形、按記錄 mPD 高度建立的建築物及道路。提供香港 1980 方格坐標 DXF、OBJ 及 GLB。</span><span class=\"hx-cta\">開啟工具 &rarr;</span></span></span></a><em class=\"hx-kind k-lab\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hant\">實驗室</span></em></li><li class=\"hx-s fit ed k-journal\" data-i=\"5\" data-new=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><a href=\"journal/not-yet-known-expected-by-date/\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"hx-bg\"><img data-src=\"../journal/img/not-yet-known-expected-by-date/thumb.webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\"></span><span class=\"hx-card\"><img data-src=\"../journal/img/not-yet-known-expected-by-date/01.webp\" sizes=\"(max-width:860px) 100vw, 72vw\" alt=\"\" width=\"1080\" height=\"1350\" decoding=\"async\"></span><span class=\"hx-ed\"><span class=\"zh hx-ei\" lang=\"zh-Hant\"><span class=\"hx-ek\">2026 年 10 月 20 日 · 建築規例</span><span class=\"hx-eq\"><b aria-hidden=\"true\">&ldquo;</b>附錄二亦指出，資料應隨設計推進而補充，項目初期收集的資料「不大可能足夠」。</span><span class=\"hx-cta\">閱讀全文 &rarr;</span></span></span></a><em class=\"hx-kind k-journal\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hant\">文章</span></em></li>", "caps": "<div class=\"hx-c c-journal\" data-i=\"3\" data-new=\"\" hidden><p class=\"hx-no\"><span class=\"hx-kl k-journal\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hant\">文章</span></span><span class=\"zh hx-of\" lang=\"zh-Hant\">第 4 項，共 7 項</span></p><h2 class=\"hx-ti\"><a href=\"journal/add-one-building-what-happens-wind/\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hant\">加一座樓，條街嘅風會點變？</span></a></h2><p class=\"hx-m\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hant\">2026 年 10 月 21 日 · AI 新聞</span></p><p class=\"zh hx-sum has-q\" lang=\"zh-Hant\">早排我整咗個免費小工具，HK Wind Sketch 香港風環境草圖，放咗喺我網站嘅 Lab。今日講下我點用。我自己嘅用法好簡單：一次只改一樣嘢。一座樓、一條隙、一個風向，改完睇下邊度變咗。</p><p class=\"zh hx-q\" lang=\"zh-Hant\">全部喺你部電腦度計，冇嘢上載。</p><p class=\"hx-go\"><a class=\"hx-btn2\" href=\"journal/add-one-building-what-happens-wind/\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hant\">閱讀全文</span> &rarr;</a></p></div><div class=\"hx-c c-lab\" data-i=\"4\" data-new=\"\" hidden><p class=\"hx-no\"><span class=\"hx-kl k-lab\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hant\">實驗室</span></span><b>T08</b><span class=\"zh hx-of\" lang=\"zh-Hant\">第 5 項，共 7 項</span></p><h2 class=\"hx-ti\"><a href=\"lab/hk-site-model/\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hant\">香港地盤模型</span></a></h2><p class=\"hx-m\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hant\">立體地盤模型 · 香港</span></p><p class=\"zh hx-sum\" lang=\"zh-Hant\">在香港任何地方選取 250 米、500 米或 1 公里見方的範圍，下載立體體量模型：地形、按記錄 mPD 高度建立的建築物及道路。提供香港 1980 方格坐標 DXF、OBJ 及 GLB。</p><p class=\"hx-go\"><a class=\"hx-btn2\" href=\"lab/hk-site-model/\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hant\">開啟工具</span> &rarr;</a></p></div><div class=\"hx-c c-journal\" data-i=\"5\" data-new=\"\" hidden><p class=\"hx-no\"><span class=\"hx-kl k-journal\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hant\">文章</span></span><span class=\"zh hx-of\" lang=\"zh-Hant\">第 6 項，共 7 項</span></p><h2 class=\"hx-ti\"><a href=\"journal/not-yet-known-expected-by-date/\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hant\">「尚未知悉，預計於某日確定</span></a></h2><p class=\"hx-m\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hant\">2026 年 10 月 20 日 · 建築規例</span></p><p class=\"zh hx-sum has-q\" lang=\"zh-Hant\">」這可能是施工前資料（pre-construction information）中最有用的一句。</p><p class=\"zh hx-q\" lang=\"zh-Hant\">附錄二亦指出，資料應隨設計推進而補充，項目初期收集的資料「不大可能足夠」。</p><p class=\"hx-go\"><a class=\"hx-btn2\" href=\"journal/not-yet-known-expected-by-date/\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hant\">閱讀全文</span> &rarr;</a></p></div>", "rows": "<li class=\"k-journal\" data-new=\"\"><a href=\"journal/add-one-building-what-happens-wind/\" data-go=\"3\"><span class=\"hx-rn\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hant\">文章</span></span><span class=\"zh hx-rt\" lang=\"zh-Hant\">加一座樓，條街嘅風會點變？</span><span class=\"hx-ry\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hant\">10月21日</span></span></a></li><li class=\"k-lab\" data-new=\"\"><a href=\"lab/hk-site-model/\" data-go=\"4\"><span class=\"hx-rn\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hant\">實驗室</span></span><span class=\"zh hx-rt\" lang=\"zh-Hant\">香港地盤模型</span><span class=\"hx-ry\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hant\">10月21日</span></span></a></li><li class=\"k-journal\" data-new=\"\"><a href=\"journal/not-yet-known-expected-by-date/\" data-go=\"5\"><span class=\"hx-rn\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hant\">文章</span></span><span class=\"zh hx-rt\" lang=\"zh-Hant\">「尚未知悉，預計於某日確定</span><span class=\"hx-ry\"><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hant\">10月20日</span></span></a></li>"}}